---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/base-layout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/site-footer.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/site-header.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Peso"
  description="Read the draft privacy information for Peso’s limited US web beta."
>
  <div class="page-shell legal-shell">
    <SiteHeader compact />
    <main id="main-content" class="legal-page">
      <p class="eyebrow">Last updated August 4, 2026</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>This public website is an informational preview only. Signup, uploads, analysis, and email collection are unavailable. The draft below describes the future beta, not services currently offered on this site.</p>
      <div class="legal-notice" role="note">
        <strong>Beta draft for professional review.</strong>
        <p>This page is product copy for the private prototype and is not approved legal advice or launch-ready policy.</p>
      </div>
      <p>
        Peso is being prepared as a limited, free web beta with open signup
        through US IP addresses. IP location does not establish residency. This draft explains the intended
        data handling so testers can evaluate the experience before launch.
      </p>
      <h2>Information the beta expects to use</h2>
      <p>Account details such as email address and verification status; profile and optional workout details; squat videos and analysis results; security and reliability logs; and product analytics only after explicit consent.</p>
      <h2>How information is intended to be used</h2>
      <p>To authenticate accounts, receive and analyze squat videos, display and save results, enforce beta capacity, protect the service, diagnose failures, and improve the experience with opt-in feedback.</p>
      <h2>Video and analysis data</h2>
      <p>Video uploads are intended to remain private to the account owner. The planned beta policy removes unsaved videos, analysis results, and history entries after 3 days from upload registration. Saved videos and results remain until you delete them. Videos will not be copied or retained for model training. Verification of deletion, the processor list, and legal review remain launch requirements.</p>
      <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
      <p>Peso intends to collect only a short list of product events after consent. Video names, URLs, frames, coaching results, and other video-derived data will not be sent to analytics. Session replay will remain disabled.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can decline optional analytics, discard an unsaved result, and request account or Saved Lift deletion through the support process that will be published before launch.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Formal privacy contact details will be added after the production domain and support address are chosen.</p>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
